al fa-comment-dots\"></i>Intercom</div>\n        <div class=\"aic-orbit-item pos-4 rv\" style=\"--tool-color:#FF7A59\"><i class=\"fab fa-hubspot\"></i>HubSpot Service</div>\n        <div class=\"aic-orbit-item pos-5 rv\" style=\"--tool-color:#4A154B\"><i class=\"fab fa-slack\"></i>Slack</div>\n        <div class=\"aic-orbit-item pos-6 rv\" style=\"--tool-color:#6264A7\"><i class=\"fab fa-microsoft\"></i>Teams</div>\n        <div class=\"aic-orbit-item pos-7 rv\" style=\"--tool-color:#000000\"><i class=\"fal fa-file-alt\"></i>Notion</div>\n        <div class=\"aic-orbit-item pos-8 rv\" style=\"--tool-color:#172B4D\"><i class=\"fab fa-confluence\"></i>Confluence</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>','HW Support 24/7 — Support client IA | Hello World Agency','Agent IA support client : réponses RAG, tickets automatiques, escalade humaine avec contexte. Multicanal web/email/WhatsApp/Teams, disponible 24/7.','fr');
